{"created": "2026-02-13T10:11:43.048961+00:00", "modified": "2026-03-19T12:11:28.190111+00:00", "id": 18628777, "conceptrecid": "14712896", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18628777", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.14712896", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18628777", "metadata": {"title": "Quality Control in Additive Manufacturing: Image Dataset for Defect Detection in Fused Filament Fabrication", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18628777", "publication_date": "2026-02-13", "description": "<p>This image dataset was created to support the development of image-based defect detection and quality control systems in additive manufacturing, particularly in fused filament fabrication. It includes high resolution images as well as cropped images of 3D printed objects with production defects, such as extrusion errors and layershifts and stringing errors, as well as images of defect-free prints. The data was captured from three different camera angles during production.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Please cite this repository if you use the dataset in your work.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Bast, Sebastian", "affiliation": "Trier University of Applied Sciences", "orcid": "0009-0008-4666-7579"}, {"name": "Scherer, Kai", "affiliation": "Trier University of Applied Sciences", "orcid": "0000-0003-0008-7305"}, {"name": "Wahl, Michael", "affiliation": "Trier University of Applied Sciences", "orcid": "0000-0002-9448-918X"}, {"name": "Naumann, Stefan", "affiliation": "Trier University of Applied Sciences", "orcid": "0009-0000-6542-2229"}, {"name": "Dartmann, Guido", "affiliation": "Trier University of Applied Sciences", "orcid": "0000-0002-6786-6664"}, {"name": "Didas, Stephan", "affiliation": "Trier University of Applied Sciences", "orcid": "0000-0003-4853-9008"}], "keywords": ["Additive Manufacturing", "Fused Filament Fabrication", "Artificial Intelligence", "Machine Learning", "Sustainable Production", "Quality Control", "3D Printing", "Image Classification"], "related_identifiers